##Commands

xxd
  -turns binary file content into readable content
  -e.g xxd flag.bin

zsteg
  -finds hidden content in image files (Steganography)
  -e.g zsteg flag.png

binwalk
  -displays and extracts files from any binary file
  -e.g binwalk -e flag.png

fcrackzip
  -cracks zip files using the list of passwords in a file you provided
  -e.g fcrackzip -u -D -p passwords.txt file.zip
